# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT DATA — never goes into a build context.
#
# The builder stage does `COPY . .` so that Vite can build the bundle. Without
# these lines that copy swept up:
#
#   data/submissions.json   every testator's name, parent/spouse, age, phone,
#                           address and privileged drafting instructions
#   uploads/                the actual title deeds, pattadar passbooks and
#                           draft wills
#
# Both were therefore uploaded to Render's build servers and baked into a
# builder image layer. The runtime stage never copies them, so they are absent
# from the deployed image — but they had no business leaving this machine at
# all. The server recreates both directories at startup if they are missing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data
uploads

# Local tooling that has no place in an image.
*.test.mjs
.vscode
